The tree.json files under this directory are trimmed excerpts of the DMTF Redfish public mockups
(DSP2043), taken from https://github.com/DMTF/Redfish-Publications at tag 2026.2
(commit 4f81814e399213c9055863ddaff42791c6b3706a, mockups/<tree>/). Only the resources and fields the
Turnup Redfish collector reads are kept; values are unchanged. extract.py (Apache-2.0, Turnup
contributors) regenerates them. The mockup content is distributed under the following license:

